		<name>Stellar TimeLock</name>
		<summary>Non-custodial Stellar wallet with time-locked vaults</summary>
		<desc>Stellar TimeLock is a non-custodial Stellar (XLM) wallet. Your keys stay on your device.

* Time-lock vaults: lock XLM or Stellar tokens until a date you choose, enforced by Soroban smart contracts
* Cooling-off and vesting vaults
* Send, receive and swap, signed on the device
* Multiple wallets and an address book
* Optional biometric unlock

This is the fdroid build: no Firebase/FCM, Google Play services, ML Kit or Play install referrer. QR scanning uses ZXing.

Source available under GPL-3.0-or-later. This repository is run by the Stellar TimeLock project, and the app is signed with the same key as our direct-download builds.</desc>
